@fzacek thank you so much ! yea i figured it out yesterday and now have opencode-cmux updated. 

i had to alias :
```bash
oc_openai() { OH_MY_OPENCODE_SLIM_PRESET=openai command opencode --port 0 "$@"; }
oc_pdmfc()  { OH_MY_OPENCODE_SLIM_PRESET=pdmfc  command opencode --port 0 "$@"; }

alias pdmfc='oc_pdmfc'

opencode() {
  if (( $# == 0 )) || [[ "$1" == -* ]]; then
    oc_openai "$@"
  else
    command opencode "$@"
  fi
}
```

this way opencode is set to run with `--port 0` but opencode attach doesnt run with --port 0 when delegating a sub agent. 


let me know if you found a better solution !
